OL,3,GNEWSAMental health hospital has
OL,4,A'sufficient staff to be safe'
OL,5,
OL,6,FDavid Williams, group director of
OL,7,Fstrategy and partnerships, said: "We
OL,8,Fhave looked at all of the staffing
OL,9,Fnumbers [and] the model of care.. and
OL,10,Fwe are currently happy that there are
OL,11,Fsufficient clinical staff to be safe on
OL,12,Fday one."
